  partName: Right Center Exhaust Manifold Sensor
  description: The Right Center Exhaust Manifold Sensor is a tiny, elongated sensor
    situated at the top-right-center of the engine, made of Material.001, which monitors
    exhaust gas temperature and composition, providing critical data for engine control
    and emissions regulation. This sensor is vital for maintaining optimal engine
    performance and reducing emissions. Notably, its central location allows for
    accurate and representative exhaust gas sampling.
